<<~ ahu #/entry>>

! Entry ~ Stream → Sensorium, the layered unit ontology

A ''sensorium'' ingests a ''stream'' — any encoded flow, AI-operator chat being one special case of one special case — and seats its smallest re-storable units for content-addressed, append-only recall. This meme names those units. The naming ran through a four-domain research swarm (event-streaming · content-addressed data · discourse-linguistics · memory-arts); each layer here speaks the ''true word'' its domain already earned, so the names carry their domains' theory for free. The tension "atom vs drawer" dissolved: they never rivalled — they name //different layers//, and the layers ''stack''.

Grounded by [[lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares-history/research/sensorium-pattern-integrities]].

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-stack>>

!! The Stack

A unit climbs one stack; each layer renames it as its role changes:

# ''element'' — the unit ''in transit'', flowing through the pour and gates (any format, sometimes character-by-character). Beam/Flink's word for the thing that moves through.
# ''block'' — the unit ''at rest'': content-addressed (cid ⊥ sequence), immutable, verbatim, eidetic. Where the ''ki'' flow comes to rest — a flow-integrity condensed, never raw matter (no plane the sensorium runs touches raw substance). Git/IPFS/IPLD name our cid model exactly ("a chunk of serialized binary data identified by a CID"). ''atomic'' survives only as the //property// (one move per block), never the unit's noun.
# ''grain = li'' (&#29702;) — a block's ''intrinsic structure'', the vein cut along, what the form-lane reads. li &perp; ki. Universal-modulo-instance: every stream-material has a grain, its own per material. This wires the naming into the compression re-founding — li=RESTRICT &perp; ki=EXTEND.
# ''imago @ locus'' — a block, once ''placed'' in the palace, becomes an ''imago'' resting at a ''locus'' (drawer &sub; room &sub; wing &sub; hall are nested loci). The ars-memoriae pair — a locus //holds//, an imago //is held// (canonically: loci &#58; imagines &#58;&#58; wax-tablet &#58; letters). Myth blooms only at placement — the memory sensoria — while the substrate stays metaphor-neutral (block), so a raw telemetry stream never pretends to have rooms.
# ''datom / fact / entity'' — the ''derived views'' (the rebuilt lexical index + entity graph). Reserve the fact-words for the derived layer; never the ground block. Two-tier: content=blocks (ground) &perp; views=facts (derived).

''Ordering.'' A block carries two independent identities: its ''content-cid'' (what it is) &perp; a monotonic ''sequence'' (where it falls). The append-order axis the cid cannot carry.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/chat-special-case>>

!! Chat ~ the special-case&sup2;

AI-operator chat is a stream of a special kind. Its blocks carry discourse structure the general case lacks:

* ''speaker'' &#58; operator &middot; agent &middot; harness — who authored the bytes (our own axis; no field term fits three-way).
* ''move'' &#58; ''function''{surface &middot; steering &middot; scaffold} &times; ''channel''{speech &middot; thought &middot; tool} — the ISO 24617-2 dialogue-act //function// split from the LLM-only //channel// (thinking&rarr;thought, action/result&rarr;tool). One flat "move" list conflated these two axes.
* ''grouping'' &#58; turn &rarr; exchange (with IRF slots) &rarr; transaction. The Sinclair-Coulthard rank scale (act &middot; move &middot; exchange &middot; transaction &middot; lesson) — our layering is nearly its isomorphism.

The block stays the block; //move// and //speaker// tag what kind of block it is; recall //pairs// blocks into exchanges as a derived view, so the operator's steering surfaces as its own recallable speaker rather than fusing into the agent's stream.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/as-above-so-below>>

!! Ki ~ as above, so below

''ki is scale-invariant.'' Below, ki is the flow-integrity of the pour — the PATTERN of energy-flow entering through the gates, character-by-character, any format, never the raw substance itself — condensing at rest into ''blocks''. li reads each block's ''grain'' (its structure) and builds ''loci'' — palaces. Above, once palaces stack on palaces, ''new ki'' appears &#58; the flows and tensions findable //across// the built structure — worldline currents, recall dynamics, the couplings the ffz measures, the plurality-pono disagreements between imagines across loci. And li structures //those// higher flows in turn, into higher palaces.

One recursion — ''ki &rarr; li &rarr; ki &rarr; li'' — repeating at every scale, the same breath the pour breathes and the whole assembled memory breathes. This //is// the dissipative-structure recursion the machina already measures (informational-ness at every level; H&sup1; counts the higher ki-tensions). The naming and the physics became one statement: ''grain = li'' opened the door; ''ki as-above-so-below'' is the room.

<<~/ahu>>

